9 to position1.\n\nSo the digits are:.\n\nBillions:1.\n\nHundred millions:3.\n\nTen millions:1 (from position8's digit).\n\nMillions:7 (position7).\n\nHundred thousands:5 (position6).\n\nTen thousands:0 (position5).\n\nThousands:3 (position4).\n\nHundreds:0 (position3).\n\nTens:8 (position2).\n\nOnes:6 (position1)</think>\nTherefore, the answer is "]]
