 7 + 4 = 11 (write down 1, carry over 1)\n2. The tens place: 2 + 3 + 1 = 6 (write down 6)\n3. The hundreds place: 8 + 1 = 9 (write down 9)\n4. The thousands place: 5 + 6 = 11 (write down 1, carry over 1)\n5. The ten thousands place: 1 + 5 + 1 = 7 (write down 7)\n6. The hundred thousands place: 6 + 5 = 11 (write down 1, carry over 1)\n7. The millions place: 7 + 5 + 1 = 13 (write down 3, carry over 1)\n8. The ten millions place: 5 + 4 + 1 = 10 (write down 0, carry over 1)\n9. The hundred millions place: 7 + 4 + 1 = 12 (write down 2, carry over 1)\n10. The billions place: 1 (carry over from the previous step)\n\nAnswer:\nTherefore, the final computed sum is \\boxed{1213171961}.", '']
