usands place**: 9 + 3 + 1 (carry) = 13. Write down 3, carry over 1.\n6. **Hundred thousands place**: 0 + 6 + 1 (carry) = 7.\n7. **Millions place**: 2 + 8 = 10. Write down 0, carry over 1.\n8. **Ten millions place**: 8 + 4 + 1 (carry) = 13. Write down 3, carry over 1.\n9. **Hundred millions place**: 8 + 6 + 1 (carry) = 15. Write down 5, carry over 1.\n10. **Billions place**: 1 (carry) is written as the new digit.\n\nPutting all the digits together, the final sum is:\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{1530731099}\n\\]", '']
