(write 0, carry over 1)  \n4. **Thousands place**: 7 + 9 + 1 (carry) = 17 (write 7, carry over 1)  \n5. **Ten thousands place**: 1 + 0 + 1 (carry) = 2  \n6. **Hundred thousands place**: 0 + 8 = 8  \n7. **Millions place**: 6 + 2 = 8  \n8. **Ten millions place**: 8 + 9 = 17 (write 7, carry over 1)  \n9. **Hundred millions place**: 2 + 2 + 1 (carry) = 5  \n\nPutting all the digits together, we get the final sum:\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{578825284}\n\\]", '']
