\n\n1. **Ones place**: \\(6 + 2 = 8\\)\n2. **Tens place**: \\(4 + 9 = 13\\) (write 3, carry over 1)\n3. **Hundreds place**: \\(5 + 2 + 1 = 8\\)\n4. **Thousands place**: \\(5 + 9 = 14\\) (write 4, carry over 1)\n5. **Ten-thousands place**: \\(2 + 0 + 1 = 3\\)\n6. **Hundred-thousands place**: \\(1 + 8 = 9\\)\n7. **Millions place**: \\(9 + 8 = 17\\) (write 7, carry over 1)\n8. **Ten-millions place**: \\(4 + 8 + 1 = 13\\) (write 3, carry over 1)\n9. **Hundred-millions place**: \\(1 + 9 + 1 = 11\\) (write 1, carry over 1)\n10. **Billions place**: The carried over 1 is written here.\n\nCombining all the digits from right to left, we get the final sum as 1,137,934,838.\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{1137934838}\n\\]",
