o left, carrying over when necessary:\n\n1. **Ones place**: \\(6 + 1 = 7\\)\n2. **Tens place**: \\(2 + 6 = 8\\)\n3. **Hundreds place**: \\(4 + 5 = 9\\)\n4. **Thousands place**: \\(7 + 7 = 14\\) (write 4, carry over 1)\n5. **Ten thousands place**: \\(3 + 3 + 1 = 7\\)\n6. **Hundred thousands place**: \\(7 + 7 = 14\\) (write 4, carry over 1)\n7. **Millions place**: \\(7 + 6 + 1 = 14\\) (write 4, carry over 1)\n8. **Ten millions place**: \\(7 + 8 + 1 = 16\\) (write 6, carry over 1)\n9. **Hundred millions place**: \\(6 + 5 + 1 = 12\\) (write 2, carry over 1)\n10. **Billions place**: Carry over 1.\n\nPutting all the digits together, the final sum is:\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{1264474987}\n\\]", '']
