.\n7. **Millions place**: 1 + 9 = 10 + 1 (carry) = 11. Write down 1, carry over 1.\n8. **Ten millions place**: 8 + 0 = 8 + 1 (carry) = 9. Write down 9, no carryover.\n9. **Hundred millions place**: 6 + 1 = 7. Write down 7.\n\nPutting all the digits together from highest to lowest place, the result is 791,220,950.\n\n### Answer:\nThe final computed sum is \\boxed{791220950}.", '']
