(position5), 4 (position4), 8 (position3), 2 (position2), 7 (position1).\n\nWait, let me see:.\n\nWait, the digits from position 9 down to position1 would be:.\n\nPosition9 (hundred millions place): 2.\n\nPosition8 (ten millions):7.\n\nPosition7 (millions):1.\n\nPosition6 (hundred thousands):8.\n\nPosition5 (ten thousands):1.\n\nPosition4 (thousands):4.\n\nPosition3 (hundreds):8.\n\nPosition2 (tens):2.\n\nPosition1 (units):7</think>\nTherefore, the answer is "]]
