te down 1, carry over 1.\n6. **Hundred-thousands place:** 2 + 6 + 1 (carry) = 9. Write down 9, no carryover.\n7. **Millions place:** 7 + 4 = 11. Write down 1, carry over 1.\n8. **Ten-millions place:** 5 + 7 + 1 (carry) = 13. Write down 3, carry over 1.\n9. **Hundred-millions place:** 4 + 8 + 1 (carry) = 13. Write down 3, carry over 1.\n10. **Billions place:** The final carryover of 1 is added here.\n\nCombining all the digits from left to right, the result is **1,331,916,711**.\nAnswer:\nTherefore, the final computed sum is <<answer>>1331916711<<.", '']
