 955,450,511.\n\nYes, that matches. So the final sum is 955,450,511.\n\nI think that's correct. Let me check once more with another approach, perhaps breaking into parts:\n\n244,272,509 can be written as 200,000,000 +44,000,000 +272,509.\n\n711,178,002 is 700,000,000 +11,000,000 +178,002.\n\nAdding the millions:\n\n200M +700M =900M.\n\n44M +11M =55M. Total so far:955M.\n\nThen the remaining parts:272,509 +178,002 = 450,511.\n\nAdding to the 955,000,000 gives 955,450,511. Yep, that's the same result.\n\nAlright, I think that's solid. The answer should be 955,450,511.\n\n# Answer\nTherefore, the final computed sum is 955450511.",
