ver **1**  \n10. **Billions place**: 0 + 0 + 1 (carry) = 1 → Write **1**  \n\nCombining all digits: **1,688,800,087**.  \n\nAnswer:  \nTherefore, the final computed sum is **1688800087**.", '']
