rs as whole:\n\n718,309,891 + 962,628,624.\n\nLet me add 700,000,000 + 900,000,000 = 1,600,000,000.\n\nThen 18,309,891 +62,628,624.\n\n18,309,891 + 60,000,000 =78,309,891. Then adding 2,628,624 gives 80,938,515.\n\nSo total is 1,600,000,000 +80,938,515 =1,680,938,515. Yes, that matches. So the answer should be correct.\n\n</think>", '']
