ed millions place**: \\(1 + 3 = 4\\).\n\nPutting all the digits together, we get the final sum as 444,754,754.\n\n\\[\n\\begin{array}{r}\n 142974944 \\\\\n+301779810 \\\\\n\\hline\n 444754754 \\\\\n\\end{array}\n\\]\n\nTherefore, the final computed sum is \\boxed{444754754}.", '']
