eeded:\n\n1. **Ones place:** \\(0 + 1 = 1\\)\n2. **Tens place:** \\(7 + 6 = 13\\) (write 3, carry over 1)\n3. **Hundreds place:** \\(8 + 4 + 1 = 13\\) (write 3, carry over 1)\n4. **Thousands place:** \\(3 + 1 + 1 = 5\\)\n5. **Ten thousands place:** \\(4 + 3 = 7\\)\n6. **Hundred thousands place:** \\(8 + 3 = 11\\) (write 1, carry over 1)\n7. **Millions place:** \\(2 + 1 + 1 = 4\\)\n8. **Ten millions place:** \\(9 + 7 = 16\\) (write 6, carry over 1)\n9. **Hundred millions place:** \\(1 + 5 + 1 = 7\\)\n\nCombining all the digits from highest to lowest place value, we get the sum as 764,175,331.\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{764175331}\n\\]", '']
