onfirm once more with another approach.\n\nAlternatively, adding 714,801,253 + 964,876,380:\n\nLet me add the millions first:\n\n714 million + 964 million = 1,678 million.\n\nThen the remaining parts:\n\n801,253 + 876,380 = ?\n\n801,253 + 800,000 = 1,601,253\n\nThen add 76,380: 1,601,253 +76,380 = 1,677,633.\n\nSo total is 1,678,000,000 + 1,677,633 = 1,679,677,633. Yep, same result.\n\nOkay, so the answer is 1,679,677,633. So I need to present that in the template.\n</think>", '']
